					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: RECTANGLE TO MESH COLLECTION\n\nIn this example we get the bounding boxes of the collection of circles and merge them together.\nNext, we bind the rectangle to that merged bounding box. This ensures that we draw a perfect rectangle around the bounds of the moving circles.\n"
